### =========================================================================
### SpendSync API: 06. Spend Intelligence & Analytics
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantId = 79ef8bff-1d87-4088-ab87-935989a568d5

### 1. Get Executive Pulse (CFO Persona)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/intelligence/pulse
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 2. Ask Procurement Policy Assistant (RAG Copilot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/intelligence/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the mandatory 3-quote policy threshold and approval matrix for hardware above 100,000 TRY?"
}

### 3. Get Budget Runway Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/intelligence/budget-runway
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4. Get Savings Opportunities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/intelligence/savings-opportunities
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 5. What-If Budget Impact Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/intelligence/what-if-simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "costCenterId": "cc100000-0000-0000-0000-000000000100",
  "additionalSpendAmount": 250000.00,
  "currency": "TRY"
}

### 6. Get CFO Executive Deck & Spend Cube
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/cfo-deck
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 7. List Immutable Audit Trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
